1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,348
RNA differs from DNA in three ways that matter.

2
00:00:04,348 --> 00:00:11,015
Its sugar is ribose, it has uracil instead of thymine, and it is usually single stranded.

3
00:00:11,015 --> 00:00:19,778
That extra hydroxyl on ribose makes it reactive and short lived: perfect for a temporary message, poor for permanent storage.

